The only alchemy recipe I use is the one to create full healing...

   N healing + 1 speed  =  N diluted extra healing

   N (diluted) extra healing + 1 gain level  =  N diluted full healing

Always dip the stack of N potions into the single one.

You may want to dilute other extra healing potions to build larger
stacks for the next processing stage and you may want to BUC-ID the
potions so that they merge to larger stacks. The final full healing
potions have to be blessed to be most effecive (+8 HP per potion).

